    "Name": "Cougar X",
    "Details": "Another configuration of the Cougar X using experimental technology, the Cougar X 2 can jump up to 240 meters. It also adds two tons of armor for added protection. Offensively, it can call upon a Streak LRM-15 and an ER Medium Pulse Laser\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Advanced Optics</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
